  "notes": "--- Planned Progression ---\nPlanned Progression:\nSorcerer 4/ Shadowcaster 4 ->\nNoctumancer 2/ Chaos Monk 2 ->\nShadow Adept 1/ Shadowcaster 5 ->\nNoctumancer 4/ Paladin of Slaughter 2 (Gaze of Truth ACF) ->\nNoctumancer 5/ Dragon Disciple 1 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 1/ Noctumancer 6 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 2/ Shadowcaster 6 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 3/ Noctumancer 7 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 4/ Shadowcaster 7 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 5/ Noctumancer 8 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 6/ Shadowcaster 8 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 7/ Noctumancer 9 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 8/ Shadowcaster 9 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 9/ Noctumancer 10 ->\nInsidious Corruptor 10/ Shadowcaster 10\n\nNeed: \nShadow Adept - Know (arc) 8, SC 8, Shadow Weave Magic +1 Metamagic, 3rd-level spells\nInsidious Corruptor - Drow, Evil Alignment, Bluff 9, Diplo 4, Sense Motive 4, Persuasive, Dominate Person\nNoctumancer - Know (arc) 6, Spellcraft 6, 2nd-level mysteries, 2nd-level spells\nDragon Disciple - Nondragon, Know (arc) 8, Draconic language, spontaneous arcane caster\n\nFeats:\n1st - SF(Enchantment), Extend Spell, Shadow Weave Magic\n2nd (bonus) - Extend Mystery\n3rd - Spell Penetration\n5th - Ascetic Mage\n6th - Shadow Reflection\n7th - Nocturnal Caster (Enchantment)?\n9th - \n\nFeats (to get):\nPath Focus + Greater, Extend Mystery, Enlarge Mystery, Line of Shadow, Spell Penetration + Greater, Favored Mystery (Flicker, Warp Spell, Greater Shadows Fade, Consume Spell, Tomb of Night, and/or Shadow Time)\n\nMysteries (to get, in order): Fundamental - Anything but widened eyes from ToM Apprentice - Voice of Shadow, Carpet of Shadow, Black Fire, Congress of Shadows, Flicker, Clinging Darkness Initiate - Warp Spell, Shadow Vision, Echo Spell, Curtain of Shadows, Unveil, Flood of Shadow Master - Ephemeral Image, Truth Revealed, Far Sight, Umbral Body, Shadow Time, Reflections of Things to Come, Shadow Time (x2) Alternatively: Master - Prison of Night, Truth Revealed, Far Sight, Tomb of Night, Reflections of Things to Come, Consume Essence, Reflections of Things to Come, Consume Essence",
